cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Code for: Data Preprocessing and Data Leakage in Multivariate Time Series Forecasting"
abstract: >-
  Code and Google Colab notebook that reproduce all experiments, tables and
  figures of the paper "Data Preprocessing and Data Leakage in Multivariate
  Time Series Forecasting". The study benchmarks machine learning, deep
  learning and statistical forecasting models and measures how missing value
  imputation, anomaly handling, categorical encoding, normalization and
  smoothing affect their accuracy on the hourly Beijing PM2.5 data set. It
  also compares scores against the original measurements with scores against
  the preprocessed series.
